        "sid": "2SA 15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "15",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Absalomu gabada jaliida",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iing'ata ng'asheesu gwanyaksa geaw Absalomu mutuku ea faraasajeega, sea fih haradam ea damanamughuush jea gwasalda aba madeadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea iissa Absalomu gabay ghang'eat sakteayda ak ghamiinaada aba murdeeda naweeda gal dooshta; ak iissa iimida siida mideawa ng'asheanda jea gweadu madeeda sugoocheanda eergweaksiina, iissa gaguursa Absalomu niny ak gwayeesha, “Ang'iing'i gibeahi ana mujiinajean?” Ama deepa gwayi, “Siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda gaba eemeeni ghana eemeeni aba jeeda Israeli,” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaygwayeesha Absalomu niny, “Ng'ula, ng'asheagaagu aamiyaas nea ghwahit; ak ea manda siida gheata sugoocheanda jea gooleeyseey iit.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gabiikta gwayi Absalomu gicha, “Inyeeda gwachi geawooschi siida laja girgweaguutka aba jeeda ng'eanyiida! Gwachi abeeda giliwas sih mideawa ng'asheanda ghana girgweageeda gayghwahidu heedeanyu, ak gaydaadaw aniini gitoabiiw.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea iihidu siida ak gwaneekiisa ak gamus, gayghoahaakta geatindaanyi, ak ghoang'waay niny nea ghwasam gheataanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak nih ea gidasima Absalomu buuneesean bea Israeli hidu heeda sugoocheanda eergweaksa; hean gwareengani Absalomu buuneesean bea Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea gamuudean gweanyeew ang'wan ghwalamda Absalomu ak gwayeesha sugoocheanda, “Geamuscheey nung' dawa daadayda habeawoodeanyu, ghayi eayeaksi NG'UTAMIIDA, aba Hebroni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda ghwaak habeawooda aba damanda mideewa Geshuri mida ng'eanyiida Aramu, ak gwayi, ‘Aba huumwa NG'UTAMIIDA inyas ghwanung' dabiikta Yerusalemu, abeeda daghadoawan NG'UTAMIIDA.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwalamda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwayeesha niny, “Una nea gibeahi seayu.” Hean ghang'eat, ak gawa Hebroni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu goojeakta Absalomu buuneeda aba makcheameeda aba jeeda eemoojiga sean bea Israeli, ak gwayeesha, “Asi iyoayiinyi ghuuta durumbeati, abeeda giyeeni, ‘Absalomu sugoocheanda Hebroni!’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gaweay fih bughalaji iyeenya siguursa beawa Yerusalemu nea goodeayi Absalomu was rabasta, ak gaweay jeeda leendeeda nyaawa, nea manda gida nal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea damanda adaydaawa Absalomu lukghumeeda, goojeaksa Ahitofeli bea eemeeda Giloni, was siida ghuuta Dawdi, leabu mujiineadaanyi was Gilo. Ak gamajeegiit foolayda, nea ghoahaada fuga Absalomu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dawdi gamng'awa Yerusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwahidu siida siicheagu heeda Dawdi, ak gwayeesha, “Gurooruunatka fuga Israeli ghoang'waay geat sea Absalomu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Dawdi fugaaschi sean bea gadiyeeda mideayi sea niny aba Yerusalemu, “Ang'eatng'eada, ak geemng'awji; aba gideaba iimeemng'awi ea manda siida jea gaboos aba jeedeanya aba heeda Absalomu; asi alamwaja, aba gideaba gajiidu gabay ghaghaseasa, ak ghwanung' eanyasa ng'asheega munyas, ak ghabwar mujiini aba ghuuta ng'uta.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha fuga gadiyeeda sugoocheanda aba girukusa sugoocheanda, “Ng'ula, fugaagu bea gadiyeeda ea hidaat aba sinooda gida wassean gasa ng'utamiideanyu was sugoocheanda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gawa sugoocheanda, sea fugeaba gheanyi sean nea ghwaat geeshta. Ak gwanung'usa sugoocheanda gadeem damanamughuush was gwealajeega gafur gheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gawa sugoocheanda nea ghwaat geeshta buuneesean; ak gawus aba gheeda washiini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwasik fugaaschi sean bea gadiyeeda murdeadaanyi; ea fuga sean bea Gereti, ea fuga sean bea Beleti, ea fuga sean bea Giti hita bughalaji lah ghayi eadu geeshta aba Gati, ak ghang'ata aba madeeda sugoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha sugoocheanda Itayi bea eemeeda Giti, “Ghwasaan eara ang'iing'i inyas geeteayi? Biikta, ak gindeawi sugoocheanda; aba gideaba ang'iing'i guwoosi rabascheanda, ak guwoosi mang'aweanyeanda aba gheang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ang'iing'i gihidu heeta neeki, ak aniini askweareani gaydanung' eeteaydooscheena sea aseasa, aba gideaba aniini mwaanali eara heedeagali? Biikta, ak giyaadi fuga iduupcheewi; ak gagasa ghoahiimu NG'UTAMIIDA bariinyeega huumwa ea doobiiwnata.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Itayi ak gwayeesha sugoocheanda, “Aba gidabiideata NG'UTAMIIDA, ea gidabiideata ng'utamiideanyu was sugoocheanda, heeda wassean jea goobiida ng'utamiideanyu was sugoocheanda, ada ea miyeeda gil ghana ea eaweega gil, hoowa heechea goobiida siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha Dawdi Itayi, “Asi una, aghaawa.” Ak ghoaghaaw Itayeeda eemeeda Giti, sea fugaaschi sean sea diibiga sean manang'i mideayi sea niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gooyeawda buuneesean aba ghuuta haw damanda ng'ataawa buuneesean, ak ghoaghaawa sugoocheanda ghealooda Gidroni, ak ghoaghaawa buuneesean nea gagal dareapcheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwahidu Abiyatari, ak ghwahidu eara Sadoki, sea fuga sean bea Lawi, nea gweadu sandakwajeanda neajeeda bea ASEETA; ak ghwayiin ng'eanyi sandakwajeanda neajeeda bea ASEETA, bwak ea gwariteawa buuneesean jeeda mujiini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda sugoocheanda ak gwayeesha Sadoki, “Sareana sandakwajeanda neajeeda bea ASEETA adealda jeeda mujiini. Ama aanyaschi alooheeda aba madeeda gheanyanga NG'UTAMIIDA, gaygoodeelnean ak ghwanung' dadaah sandakwajeanji ea hoorgeadaanyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ama deepa gwayi, ‘Aniini meagasseey,’ ng'ula, aniini geandi hiji, nung'waada gwasinnean niny gidadaah gideaba ghwahit aba headaanyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eara sugoocheanda gwayeesha Sadokeeda was ashoohoocheanda, “Daaha, biikta mujiini nea gibeahi seayu, ang'iing'i sea Abiyatari, sea orjoagaagu asiyeenya, Ahimasi orjeedang'u, ea Yonatan was orjeeda Abiyatari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ula, aniini gaydaamuughu niny aba neaneachajeega dareapcheeda, ea gwaleabu ng'asheanda headaang'u ak gwarukunean.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwasar Sadoki sea Abiyatari sandakwajeanda neajeeda bea ASEETA gabiikta Yerusalemu; ak goobiida saawa hoowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu gawa Dawdi nea gwasik naweeda diyeesa Giijeeda Saytuunajeega, nea gooyeawdeada nea gawa, nea ghaghus baneaguuka nea gwadukuta uhuudaanyi; nea fuga sean mideawa gwadukuta iheenga nyaawa, ak ghwascheang'da, ak gooyeawdeada nea gaweay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geerukusa Dawdi gideaba, “Ahitofeli gaba jeeda fuga iiy iiteaba geat sea Absalomu.” Ak gwayi Dawdi, “Ea NG'UTAMIIDA, geamuscheey ang'iing'i, yamwa girgweageeda Ahitofeli ghoah leendeeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghwahita Dawdi uhuuda heayeeda, was heeda sibata ASEETA, ging'ulayi, ghwahidu Hushayi bea eemeeda Arkite ak gwaroonyi niny nea sibwaash hang'daanyi nea gwanda uhuudaanyi sigeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Dawdi ak gwayeesha niny, “Ang'iing'i iisiiteayi sea aniini, gayhuuwa sareenda aba heedeanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama ibiikti mujiini, ak girukusi Absalomu, ‘gaydoaw siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda Ea sugoocheanda; gawuurji gidaghayi eawoosti siida gadiyeeda bea gweanu, asi ghamneawa gaydoaw siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda,’ abeeda gayjoornean girgweageeda Ahitofeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neada Sadoki ea Abiyatari was ashoohoodiga ea mindeawani aba hoowa? Asi gida wassean iyiing'si gheeda sugoocheanda, rukusiina Sadoki ea Abiyatari was ashoohoodiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ula, orjooga nyaawa asiyeenya gwandeayi sea saawa aba hoowa, Ahimasi was orjeeda Sadoki gil sea Yonatan, orjeeda Abiyatari; ak aba saawa gaynung' gweadu iita sean iiyiinyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 15:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwahidu Hushayi, was buweacheanda Dawdi, jeeda mujiini, damanda beawa Absalomu Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.15.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.15.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
